{"id":"1791b62b90bdbbfd","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-continuity.md","title":"有向并连续性及原书跳跃的反例","display":"df-continuity — 有向并连续性及原书跳跃的反例","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-continuity","aliases":["91-df-continuity","91-df-continuity-jump","91-df-Scott-continuity"],"display":"df-continuity — 有向并连续性及原书跳跃的反例","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-monotonicity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-continuity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-continuity</span><span>91-df-continuity-jump</span><span>91-df-Scott-continuity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuity — 有向并连续性及原书跳跃的反例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55157d609cf296e7\" href=\"?note=55157d609cf296e7\" title=\"91-df-monotonicity\">91-df-monotonicity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Directed}(\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Directed}(\\mathcal D)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 非空且任意两成员有共同包含上界。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\)</span> 为 Scott 连续性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mon}_{\\subseteq}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mon}_{\\subseteq}\\)</span> 为包含序的单调性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\coloneqq\\forall\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(C_T)\\,\n[\\operatorname{Directed}(\\mathcal D)\\to J(\\bigcup\\mathcal D)=\\bigcup_{X\\in\\mathcal D}J(X)],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\coloneqq\\forall\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(C_T)\\,\n[\\operatorname{Directed}(\\mathcal D)\\to J(\\bigcup\\mathcal D)=\\bigcup_{X\\in\\mathcal D}J(X)],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对原书单步正算子可直接给反例。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_n=\\{\\ulcorner t=t\\urcorner:t\\text{闭项且}\\operatorname{val}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)&lt;n\\}\">\\(X_n=\\{\\ulcorner t=t\\urcorner:t\\text{闭项且}\\operatorname{val}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)&lt;n\\}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{X_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\{X_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 有向，所有闭项的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=t\">\\(t=t\\)</span> 实例都在其并中。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\forall x(x=x)\\urcorner\\in J(\\bigcup_nX_n)\">\\(\\ulcorner\\forall x(x=x)\\urcorner\\in J(\\bigcup_nX_n)\\)</span>，却不在任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(X_n)\">\\(J(X_n)\\)</span>。这里使用 J 的全称子句读取输入集合中的实例，不能把它换成一次递归评估全部公式的另一个算子。\n有向连续蕴含单调性可用二元素有向集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{X,Y\\}\">\\(\\{X,Y\\}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq Y\">\\(X\\subseteq Y\\)</span>）证明。连续性允许在 ω 步并处取得固定点；一般单调算子的超限并迭代及 Hartogs 停止证明不要求连续，原备注的“连续性保证极限构造正确”已删除。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.5 的全称子句；Scott 连续性定义和反例为本地直接推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"55157d609cf296e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-monotonicity]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Directed}(\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cont}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mon}_{\\subseteq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\coloneqq\\forall\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(C_T)\\,\n[\\operatorname{Directed}(\\mathcal D)\\to J(\\bigcup\\mathcal D)=\\bigcup_{X\\in\\mathcal D}J(X)],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J).","display":true},{"tex":"X_n=\\{\\ulcorner t=t\\urcorner:t\\text{闭项且}\\operatorname{val}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)<n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{X_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"t=t","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\forall x(x=x)\\urcorner\\in J(\\bigcup_nX_n)","display":false},{"tex":"J(X_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{X,Y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq Y","display":false}],"bytes":1824,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-continuity]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[